        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1668_6083.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser nachparlich willige dienst unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gruoß</unclear>
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevoran</unclear>, edle, ehrnveste, fromme, fürsichtig
<lb n="3"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weiße</unclear>, günstige Herren, liebe <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachparn</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/>Es hatt <persName resp="#ner">Jacob Töbelin</persName> unnser mitburger vor
<lb n="5"/>gricht allhie M: <persName resp="#ner">Georg <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Strußen</unclear></persName>, so auch unn-
<lb n="6"/>ser mitburger ist unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> alten <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Töbelins</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hinden</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">witib</unclear> dises <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stieffmuoter</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Agatham</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>Laibin</persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zur</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> ehe gehabt, umb ein stuckh <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">reben</unclear>,
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einhundert</unclear> guldin an gelt unnd etwas <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haußraths</unclear>,
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wän</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gedachte</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Laibin</persName> solches von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> Tö-
<lb n="11"/>belins <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vattern</unclear> seeligen für ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khindtstheil</unclear> er-
<lb n="12"/>erbt unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hernacher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">disem</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Strußen</unclear></persName> alß
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuogebracht</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anersuocht</unclear>: <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solliches</unclear> al-
<lb n="14"/>les dem <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Thurgöwischen</placeName> unnd unnserer statt
<lb n="15"/>erbrechten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmäß</unclear> ihme <persName resp="#ner">Töbelin</persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solle</unclear> widerumb
<lb n="16"/>guetlich oder rechtlich heimfallen.
<lb n="17"/>Dises aber dem <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Strußen</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frömbd</unclear> fürkomen
<lb n="18"/>in meinung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> dem <persName resp="#ner">Töbelin</persName> seiner
<lb n="19"/>lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haußfrauwen</unclear> seeligen gegeben, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>alles <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sey</unclear> ihro für <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> dem alten <persName resp="#ner">Töbelin</persName>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogebracht</unclear> eigen guot, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eigenthumblich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear>-
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erkhent</unclear> worden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dariber</unclear> aber sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brichts</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">raths</unclear> zuoerholen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verdacht</unclear> begert,
<lb n="24"/>der ihme biß in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nechste</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gricht</unclear> uff <date resp="#ner">mit-
<lb n="25"/>wochen den 17/7 diß</date> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">künfftig</unclear> mit
<lb n="26"/>recht zuogelaßen.
<lb n="27"/>Wan dan <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihne</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Strußen</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unvergessen</unclear>, dz Herr
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1668_6084.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="28"/><persName resp="#ner">Zacharias <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rungier</unclear></persName> der zeit burger in der Statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sant
<lb n="29"/>Gallen</placeName>, gedachter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Taebinin</unclear> in ihrem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wittibstand</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vormunder</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vogt</unclear> gewesen, der umb alles
<lb n="31"/>abtheilen zwüschen ihro und des <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Taebelius</unclear></persName> erben
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bschechen</unclear>, auch umb rechtlich und güetlich ge-
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üebten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbstreitt</unclear> guot wüssen haben solle,
<lb n="34"/>were <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Er</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Struß</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dessen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeügensag</unclear> sehr noth.
<lb n="35"/>Dieweil aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeüg</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiehäro</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">remittiert</unclear> auch ohne <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürweißenden</unclear> com-
<lb n="37"/>paßbrieff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">villicht</unclear> nit möchte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhört</unclear> wer-
<lb n="38"/>den, Alß were sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochfleissiges</unclear> pitten
<lb n="39"/>an unns wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> disen compaßbrieff
<lb n="40"/>mittheilen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wölten</unclear>. Welliches <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> für-
<lb n="41"/>derung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> grund der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">warheit</unclear> wir ihme
<lb n="42"/>nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weigeren</unclear> wöllen.
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Derowegen</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear> unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachparliches</unclear>
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuochen</unclear>, wöllet <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehebekanten</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rungier</unclear></persName>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eweren</unclear> burger für <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear> oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierzue</unclear> ver-
<lb n="46"/>ordnete citiern lassen, auff des <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Strussen</unclear>
<lb n="47"/>fürbringen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeügen</unclear>, ihme den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeügen</unclear>-
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eid</unclear> angeben, darüber examiniern unnd hie-
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rauff</unclear> sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußsag</unclear> auch schrifftlichen auß-
<lb n="50"/>zug, so er des <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Strussen</unclear> erforderen nach
<lb n="51"/>einichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurde</unclear>, verschlossen unnserm
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Stattgricht</unclear> zuekomen lassen, damit der
<lb n="53"/>richter desto sicherer auff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dasselbig</unclear> unnd
<lb n="54"/>was sonsten deßhalb eingebracht, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüsse</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1668_6085.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoverhalten</unclear>. Das stoht gegen üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear>
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> jederzeit nachparlich und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotwillig</unclear>
<lb n="57"/>zuobeschulden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">würdt</unclear> sich auch der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Senff</unclear>
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemüben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">danckhbarlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerzei</unclear>-
<lb n="59"/>gen.
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuo</unclear> disem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zügentag</unclear> ist dem <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Döbelin</unclear></persName> durch
<lb n="61"/>unnsern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">grichtsknecht</unclear> für üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mor</unclear>-
<lb n="62"/>gen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerscheinen</unclear>, so er will, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> hauß
<lb n="63"/>und hoff, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkhündt</unclear> worden. Gottes
<lb n="64"/>bewahr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darmit</unclear> unns sambt unnd
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonnders</unclear> wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befolhen</unclear>. Datum <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="66"/>mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnserem</unclear> der Statt minderen Se-
<lb n="67"/>crets Innsigill <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwahrt</unclear> den <origDate resp="#ner">15/5 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bris</unclear> Mar-
<lb n="68"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tii</unclear> Anno <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">d</unclear> 610</origDate>.
<lb n="69"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Stattaman unnd
<lb n="70"/>Raath</orgName> daselbst.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1668_6086.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Canzleybrief</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear> <origDate when="1610-03-05" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">5</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">martii</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1610</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="72"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vor</unclear> den Edlen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ehrenvesten</unclear>, Frommen,
<lb n="73"/>Fürsichtigen unnd Weisen herren <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Bur-
<lb n="74"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">germeister</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhath</unclear> der Statt Sant
<lb n="75"/>Gallen</orgName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zevereffnen</unclear>.
<lb n="76"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Btr</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zwußchen</unclear> <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Johannes <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lumpert</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jeorg</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Straußen</unclear></persName>.
</p>
